---
title: Pipeline Architecture
---
flowchart TD
    subgraph Triggers
        PR[Pull Request to main]
        PUSH_F[Push: feature/*, bug/*, hotfix/*]
        PUSH_R[Push: release/*]
        PUSH_M[Push: main]
    end

    subgraph "PR Validation (required check)"
        PRV_COMPILE[Stage 1: Compile X++<br/>build-xpp.yml]
        PRV_INTEG[Stage 2: Integration Test<br/>Provision → 3h wait → Copy DB<br/>→ Deploy → DB Sync → Test → Teardown]
    end

    subgraph Build
        BUILD[build.yml<br/>Compile + Package + Publish Artifact]
    end

    subgraph Environment Provisioning
        PROV[provision-environment.yml<br/>New-AdminPowerAppEnvironment<br/>+ branch tag in description]
        COPY_POST[post-provision-copy.yml<br/>Wait 4h + Match governance + Copy DB]
    end

    subgraph "Environment Cleanup (daily schedule)"
        CLEANUP_P[cleanup-environments.yml<br/>Delete orphaned envs]
    end

    subgraph "Deploy Pipeline (release/* only)"
        UAT[Deploy to UAT<br/>deploy-finops-package.yml]
        DM[Deploy to DM<br/>deploy-finops-package.yml]
    end

    subgraph "Release Pipeline (after DM succeeds)"
        GOLD[Deploy to GOLD<br/>deploy-finops-package.yml]
        PROD[Deploy to PROD<br/>deploy-finops-package.yml]
    end

    PR --> PRV_COMPILE
    PRV_COMPILE --> PRV_INTEG
    PRV_INTEG -->|pass| MERGE[Merge to main]

    PUSH_F --> BUILD
    PUSH_F --> PROV
    PUSH_R --> BUILD
    PUSH_M --> BUILD

    PROV --> COPY_POST
    PROV -.->|branch deleted| CLEANUP_P

    BUILD -->|release/* only| UAT
    UAT -->|succeeded| DM
    DM -->|succeeded| GOLD
    GOLD -->|approval + succeeded| PROD

